    "title": "“観察者”との放課後",
    "enTitle": "After School With an Observer",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "放課後の廊下で、同級生と思われる生徒と\n一緒にいるネオユニヴァースを見かけた。\n何やら足元に散らばっているようだ。",
            "enText": "I spot Neo Universe and a student I assume \nto be her classmate in a corridor after school, \nbits of something or other spread at their feet.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 119,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 130,
                    "pathId": -590558242746871691
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 130,
                    "pathId": 5439907122761946900
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7975478172901781052,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クラスメイトのウマ娘",
            "enName": "Classmate",
            "jpText": "も～、あたしのバカ……全部バラバラだし。\nてか何で教材の地球儀が立体パズルなの……？",
            "enText": "Aaahh, I'm so stupid. Look at this mess. \nWhy the heck's this globe a 3D puzzle \nanyway, isn't it for class use…?",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 99,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 110,
                    "pathId": -8754049817235862474
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 110,
                    "pathId": -3765799452155504016
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7480760262472320329,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "ネオユニヴァースは“ILLN”を拾ったよ。\nN36°58' - 42°30'\nW87°30' - 91°30'だね。",
            "enText": "Neo Universe picked up ILLN. This covers \n36°58'–42°30'N 87°30'–91°30'W.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 120,
            "voiceIdx": 76,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 147,
                    "pathId": -4485067872834541620
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 131,
                    "pathId": -1735085442730100085
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1640379366671580633,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クラスメイトのウマ娘",
            "enName": "Classmate",
            "jpText": "へ？　え、っと……このピース、どこのだろ。\nとりあえずありがと！",
            "enText": "Wha? Uhhh… where does this piece go…? \nThanks by the way!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 86,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 62,
                    "pathId": -992657426707847958
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 97,
                    "pathId": -942479717616428332
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1712440896844763329,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "どうやら2人は立体パズル型の地球儀を\n落としてしまったようだ。よく見ると、\nピースは国や州の形になっている。",
            "enText": "<i>Ah</i>, they dropped a 3D puzzle of the earth. \nThe pieces seem to be in the shape of \ncountries and other large regions.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 115,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "俺も手伝うよ",
                    "enText": "I'll help out too.",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "私も手伝うよ",
                    "enText": "I'll help out too.",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 126,
                    "pathId": 5794340823237104056
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 126,
                    "pathId": 8953841361525533810
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3825411364740113174,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クラスメイトのウマ娘",
            "enName": "Classmate",
            "jpText": "ありがとうございます！\n正直、全然わからなくて……\n国や州の正確な場所なんて、難しすぎて――",
            "enText": "Oh, thank you! Not gonna lie, I'm really lost. \nCountries? States? Provinces? You can't \nexpect me to know where <i>all</i> of these go…",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 105,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 99,
                    "pathId": -3585946137145967293
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 111,
                    "pathId": -3802651769026903434
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2967416815107019090,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "“ILLN”……\n“ドッキング”……成功だよ。",
            "enText": "ILLN: Docking complete.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 75,
            "voiceIdx": 37,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 99,
                    "pathId": 8423752633059304207
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 111,
                    "pathId": 6579395455900472966
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4641814415016002483,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "見るとネオユニヴァースが手にしたピースを、\nアメリカの一角へピタリとはめ込んでいた。\n確かシカゴのあたりだ。何州だったか……。",
            "enText": "I look up and see Neo Universe fit the piece \nshe was holding perfectly into the American \ncontinent. What state was that again? If I'm \nnot mistaken, it's near the Chicago area…",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 127,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 150,
                    "pathId": -1726046493971122967
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 138,
                    "pathId": 1979686227813513347
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7204453130497252766,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "“HNK”……。\n“MNC”……。",
            "enText": "HNK… MNC…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 67,
            "voiceIdx": 88,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 43,
                    "pathId": 8297214778330385652
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 78,
                    "pathId": -866353786182717210
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 47292876077546057,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "……“ドッキング”、成功。",
            "enText": "…Dockings complete.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 61,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 99,
                    "pathId": -2445734708578635315
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -9126551930566342999
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2216021244103790800,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "あの場所は香港と、もう1つは……モナコか？\nピースには地名も書いていないというのに、\n彼女は迷いなくはめていた。",
            "enText": "That first one's Hong Kong, and the other… \nMonaco? She seemed to have no trouble \nfitting these unnamed pieces together.",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 118,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "まさか正解の配置を……全て理解している？",
                    "enText": "<size=38>Can you actually locate every single place…?</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "これは……一種の天才的なパズルスキルだな",
                    "enText": "That's… a useful gift for puzzles like this.",
                    "nextBlock": 20
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "これは……一種の天才的なパズルスキルだね",
                    "enText": "That's… a useful gift for puzzles like this.",
                    "nextBlock": 20
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 342,
                    "pathId": -7976414107161466791
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 147,
                    "pathId": 5182132559005687259
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1717518376870732412,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
