            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "では、先程のアルファベットと数字の羅列は\nヒントだったのだろうか。試しにイタリアの\nピースをネオユニヴァースに見せてみた。",
            "enText": "Does that mean those letters and numbers \nearlier were a hint of sorts? Curious, I show \nNeo Universe the piece making up Italy.",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 124,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 356,
                    "pathId": 6899136378090819459
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 147,
                    "pathId": 1491832591880628314
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1488192855865187748,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "それは……“ITNA”……。\nN37°- 47°\nE7°- 19°……だね。",
            "enText": "That is… ITNA… it covers 37°–47°N 7°–19°E.",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 95,
            "voiceIdx": 79,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 120,
                    "pathId": 5404961310213101159
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 106,
                    "pathId": 2839942772897475041
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4486760868097266234,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "ネットでイタリアの概要を確認してみる。\nアルファベットは該当なし、独自の略号か？\nそして数字は、凡その緯度経度らしかった。",
            "enText": "I quickly look up info on Italy online. \nThe letters don't appear, are they a unique \nabbreviation of hers? The numbers roughly \nline up with its geographic coordinates.",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 124,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "そうか、緯度と経度を教えてくれてたのか！",
                    "enText": "Ah, so you were telling us its coordinates!",
                    "nextBlock": 16
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "そっか、緯度と経度を教えてくれてたんだ！",
                    "enText": "Ah, so you were telling us its coordinates!",
                    "nextBlock": 16
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 135,
                    "pathId": 5199434453014704824
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 135,
                    "pathId": -7495316911256448260
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4863662161566689840,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クラスメイトのウマ娘",
            "enName": "Classmate",
            "jpText": "えっ？　じゃあ、わからないピースは\nユニヴァースさんに聞けば……！\nなんとかなりそうですね！",
            "enText": "Huh? So… if we just ask Universe about \nthe pieces we don't know… we'll get this \ndone somehow, right!?",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 105,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 281,
                    "pathId": 4831395752154606489
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 116,
                    "pathId": 6775895004077922031
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 116,
                    "pathId": -8671281234871702831
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6682201619538095700,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クラスメイトのウマ娘",
            "enName": "Classmate",
            "jpText": "かんせーい！　にしても、緯度と経度が全部\nわかるなんて、ユニヴァースさんすごすぎ！\n助かっちゃった、ありがとね！",
            "enText": "We did it! Who'd think you have latitudes \nand longitudes memorized though, that's \nincredible! You were a big help, thanks!",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 118,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 181,
                    "pathId": 6815585211590695418
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 214,
                    "pathId": -1097271812915047928
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 243,
                    "pathId": -7143882959188655932
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5430950358575934539,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "……ふふ。\nどういたしまして……だよ。",
            "enText": "…Heheh. You're… welcome.",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 69,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 181,
                    "pathId": -4237569334533488267
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 80,
                    "pathId": -814009692567233124
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 80,
                    "pathId": 1625016376874922650
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8811135310364260280,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "お礼を言われたネオユニヴァースの表情は、\nなんだか少し、嬉しそうだった。",
            "enText": "It was subtle, but I thought this expression \nof gratitude effected a faint smile on Neo \nUniverse's face.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "origClipLength": 91,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 181,
                    "pathId": 7755040540491785787
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": 6785227781713866320
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": -5204382086915621742
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1552688458997618724,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "世界地図が全て頭に入っていて、ピースを\n瞬時に判別しているとしか思えないと伝える。",
            "enText": "I can only conclude that she has the whole \nworld map memorized and can identify pieces \nin the blink of an eye. When I mention this…",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 98,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 356,
                    "pathId": -6901565763460822174
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 141,
                    "pathId": -5317232872367315701
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3952977832310179949,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クラスメイトのウマ娘",
            "enName": "Classmate",
            "jpText": "ホントに！？　なら……ユニヴァースさん、\nパズル、最後まで手伝ってもらってもいい！？\nユニヴァースさんが頼りなの、お願いっ！",
            "enText": "For real?! Then… can you help me put this \nwhole thing back together, Universe? \nPlease, I don't think I can do it without you!",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 125,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "俺たちも自力でわかるところはやるから",
                    "enText": "Us two will do what we can too.",
                    "nextBlock": 22
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "私たちも自力でわかるところはやるから",
                    "enText": "Us two will do what we can too.",
                    "nextBlock": 22
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 161,
                    "pathId": -8191597292757649947
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 136,
                    "pathId": -4585100669949763827
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1509856784671278862,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "アファーマティブ。\n“UKP”……『わからない』は、ここへ。",
            "enText": "Affirmative. Send UKPs… Unknowns… to me.",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 84,
            "voiceIdx": 69,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -8580812823604193405
